--[[--------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Notes:
-- * EOZ is implemented as a string, "EOZ"
-- * Format of z structure (ZIO)
--     z.n       -- bytes still unread
--     z.p       -- last read position position in buffer
--     z.reader  -- chunk reader function
--     z.data    -- additional data
