  Visual representation for reference:

   31    |    |     |            0      bit position
    +-----+-----+-----+----------+
    |  B  |  C  |  A  |  Opcode  |      iABC format
    +-----+-----+-----+----------+
    -  9  -  9  -  8  -    6     -      field sizes
    +-----+-----+-----+----------+
    |   [s]Bx   |  A  |  Opcode  |      iABx | iAsBx format
    +-----+-----+-----+----------+

