	doc["Graphic"] = [==[
	Graphic ( string `polygon`, Vector2 `size`, table `style`, table `config` ) [constructor]
		returns Graphic `object`, Frame `graphic`
	
	Creates a basic GUI graphic from a polygon or specified preset.
	
