	doc["ScrollingList"] = [==[
	ScrollingList ( table `list`, number `entry_height` ) [constructor]
		returns: ScrollingList `object`, Frame `scrolling_frame`
	
	Creates a scrollable list designed to display a large number of items.
	
	Arguments:
		`list`
